    {
      "id": "p0030-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sometimes, literal translations simply come across as odd or confusing. Occasionally, they might even carry extra, unintended meanings in the target language. If left as-is, these translations risk conveying something the original creator never intended.",
        "raw": "Sometimes, literal translations simply come across as odd or confusing.\nOccasionally, they might even carry extra, unintended meanings in the target\nlanguage. If left as-is, these translations risk conveying something the original\ncreator never intended.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29320904,
          0.08894286,
          0.88844901,
          0.15728571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29118335,
          0.08822857,
          0.90430007,
          0.15835714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有时，直译只是显得古怪或令人困惑；有时却会在目标语言里带出原本没有的意思。若原样保留，就可能传达创作者从未想表达的内容。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
